X」、「本公司」、「我們」或「我們的」）是一家全球應用解決方案提供商，為利基市場提供日常生活中的關鍵任務組件。公司幾乎所有的業務活動都是透過 50 多家全資子公司開展的，這些子公司具有「信任、團隊和卓越」的共同價值觀。 IDEX 多元化的企業家族致力於打造可改善生活的值得信賴的解決方案，並以創新和好奇的態度尋求解決客戶最具挑戰​​性的應用技術問題。這些企業擁有高度自治權，但都透過採用 IDEX Difference 團結在一起，這是一種偉大團隊的理念，他們擁護 8020 原則，同時仍然高度專注於為客戶服務。 IDEX 於 1987 年 9 月 24 日在德拉瓦州註冊成立。"},{"en":"The Company has three reportable segments: Health & Science Technologies (\"HST\"), Fluid & Metering Technologies (\"FMT\") and Fire & Safety/Diversified Products (\"FSDP\"). The segments are structured around how to best serve customer needs, with each segment consisting of businesses that have product and end market similarities as well as common distribution methods and production processes. This structure enables management efficiency, aligns IDEX's operations with its focus on organic growth, strategic acquisitions and capital allocation priorities and provides transparency about the Company's performance to external stakeholders.","zh":"該公司擁有三個可報告部門：健康與科學技術（“HST”）、流體與計量技術（“FMT”）以及消防與安全/多元化產品（“FSDP”）。這些細分市場圍繞著如何最好地滿足客戶需求而構建，每個細分市場都由具有產品和終端市場相似性以及共同分銷方法和生產流程的業務組成。這種結構提高了管理效率，使 IDEX 的營運與有機成長、策略性收購和資本分配優先事項的重點保持一致，並向外部利害關係人提供了公司績效的透明度。"},{"en":"The table below illustrates the share of Net sales and Adjusted EBITDA contributed by each segment on the basis of total segments (not total Company) for the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024.","zh":"下表說明了截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日和 2024 年 12 月 31 日止年度各部門在總部門（而非公司總數）的基礎上貢獻的淨銷售額和調整後 EBITDA 的份額。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"In 2025, the Company did not have any customers that accounted for more than 3% of net sales. Since the Company serves a wide variety of markets, customer concentrations are not significant.","zh":"2025年，本公司無佔淨銷售額3%以上的客戶。由於公司服務的市場廣泛，客戶集中度並不高。"},{"en":"The Company's products and services are available worldwide, with manufacturing, sales, distribution, service and/or administrative facilities located in more than 20 countries. The businesses located outside the U.S. are primarily based in the United Kingdom, Germany, the Netherlands, Canada, Italy, China and India. The Company's geographic diversity allows it to draw on the skills of a global workforce, provides greater stability to its operations, allows the Company to drive economies of scale, provides revenue streams that may help offset economic trends that are specific to individual economies and offers the Company an opportunity to access new markets for products.","zh":"該公司的產品和服務遍及全球，在 20 多個國家設有製造、銷售、分銷、服務和/或管理設施。 The businesses located outside the U.S. are primarily based in the United Kingdom, Germany, the Netherlands, Canada, Italy, China and India.公司的地理多樣性使其能夠利用全球勞動力的技能，提高運營的穩定性，使公司能夠推動規模經濟，提供有助於抵消經濟體特有的經濟體特有的經濟趨勢"}],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Health & Science Technologies","val":1495500000,"zh":"健康與科學技術"},{"name":"Fluid & Metering Technologies","val":1224000000,"zh":"流體與計量技術"},{"name":"Fire & Safety Diversified Products","val":745300000,"zh":"消防安全多元化產品"}],"total":3457500000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":1760800000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Europe","val":846200000,"zh":"歐洲"},{"name":"Asia","val":563000000,"zh":"亞洲"},{"name":"Other Geographical Areas","val":165100000,"zh":"Other Geographical Areas"},{"name":"North America Excluding United States","val":129699999.99999999,"zh":"North America Excluding United States"}],"total":3457500000}},"peers":["AME","ALLE","FTV","MTD","NDSN"]}}